<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade active, demand good. Slaughter steers and heifers $1.00 higher than last Tuesday.</p>
<p>Steers: Choice, Select and Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 72.00-73.50, few packages 74.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Choice, Select and Choice 2-4 1100-1250 lbs 72.00-73.50, few packages 74.00.</p>
</text>
